('saas-growth-audit','SaaS Growth Audit','Your paid funnel is leaking qualified pipeline.','A focused audit for B2B SaaS teams spending over $10k/month: conversion tracking, campaign structure, landing page match and offer strength — reviewed in one pass.','Book Your Free Strategy Call','Get Your Free Marketing Audit','B2B SaaS marketing leaders','saas-growth-audit','active',current_date - 20,current_date + 70),
('ecommerce-roas-reset','E-commerce ROAS Reset','Spending more and earning less? Start with audience overlap.','For e-commerce teams whose blended ROAS slipped during scale-up. We review audience structure, creative rotation, feed health and post-purchase lifecycle.','Book Your Free Strategy Call','Get Your Free Marketing Audit','DTC and e-commerce operators','ecommerce-roas-reset','active',current_date - 12,current_date + 78),
('local-demand-capture','Local Demand Capture','Twelve locations, twelve sets of numbers.','A multi-location growth review covering location page architecture, local schema, geo-segmented paid campaigns and per-location conversion tracking.','Book Your Free Strategy Call','Get Your Free Marketing Audit','Multi-location service businesses','local-demand-capture','active',current_date - 5,current_date + 85);
